<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of games played in the Spanish first division on Saturday: Athletic Bilbao 2 (Jose Mari Garcia 62nd minute, Julen Guerrero 75th) Barcelona 1 (Abelardo Fernandez 25th). Halftime 0-1. Attendance 44,000. Extremadura 1 (Carlos Dure 60th) Sporting Gijon 2 (Julio Salinas 52nd, 54th). 0-0. 8,000.</p>
</text>
